\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {XX}{\ignorespaces Frozen train-unit heuristic $\phi $ used by the RAVEN-Design / RAVEN-NoDesign rule. Zero test: frozen $\pi ^{\mathrm  {tar}}(k(i),s(i))$ for the occupancy-attached client; a missing key is $0$. The zero test does not verify positivity on target-positive pairs. RAVEN-Design if and only if $\phi =0$; when $\phi >0$, RAVEN-NoDesign uses an uncorrected opportunity factor ($\setbox \z@ \hbox {\mathsurround \z@ $\textstyle \zeta $}\mathaccent "0362{\zeta }=1$). U-Air $25.5\%$ is EventTrace occurrence, not this switch.}}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
